# Nothing here is required. The app runs with zero configuration: it reads the
# bundled 60-clip core from src/data, and the full 4,491-clip corpus from
# public/manifest.json + public/audio.
#
# The only variable the client understands is the dataset server it falls back
# to when a clip has no bundled file (a trimmed build, or a clip discovered live
# from the dataset). Point it at a mirror or your own proxy if you run one.

# NEXT_PUBLIC_HF_DATASETS_SERVER=https://datasets-server.huggingface.co
